      "created": 1787138818,
      "updated": 1787138818
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8593cf0000000000a34556",
      "text": " [終]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787139024,
      "updated": 1787139024
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8593d60000000000a34557",
      "text": "  [https://scrapbox.io/api/pages/villagepump/終/icon#.png]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787139031,
      "updated": 1787139309
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8593010000000000a34527",
      "text": " [サービス終了のお知らせ]（[サ終]）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787138818,
      "updated": 1787139060
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85933b0000000000a34534",
      "text": " [世界終了のお知らせ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787138876,
      "updated": 1787139003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85950e0000000000a34567",
      "text": " 　[世界終焉シナリオ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787139343,
      "updated": 1787139391
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8595410000000000a34569",
      "text": " 　[終末世界モノ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787139394,
      "updated": 1787139762
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8597f60000000000a3457a",
      "text": " [日本終了のお知らせ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787140087,
      "updated": 1787140100
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85981a0000000000a3457f",
      "text": " 　イーロン・マスク「出生率が死亡率を上回るような変化が起きない限り、[日本はいずれ消滅する]でしょう」",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787140123,
      "updated": 1787140904
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8594c80000000000a34564",
      "text": " [ご愛読ありがとうございました]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787139273,
      "updated": 1787140055
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8597d70000000000a34579",
      "text": " [先生の次回作にご期待ください]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787140055,
      "updated": 1787140055
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8596d10000000000a34572",
      "text": " [本当に、本当にありがとうございました]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787139794,
      "updated": 1787139802
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85993e0000000000a34584",
      "text": " [今日はもう駄目です]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787140415,
      "updated": 1787140415
    },
    {
      "id": "6a859d570000000000a345bb",
      "text": " えっ、こんな状況でも[入れる保険があるんですか]！？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787141464,
      "updated": 1787141818
    },
    {
      "id": "6a859d570000000000a345bc",
      "text": " 俺、[この戦争が終わったら〇〇するんだ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787141464,
      "updated": 1787141819
    },
    {
      "id": "6a859d570000000000a345bd",
      "text": " [故郷に帰ったら〇〇する]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787141464,
      "updated": 1787141821
    },
    {
      "id": "6a859ec50000000000b41a37",
      "text": " [- [AしたらBする]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787141830,
      "updated": 1787141868
    },
    {
      "id": "6a859eb10000000000b41a36",
      "text": " [死亡フラグ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787141810,
      "updated": 1787141810
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85971e0000000000a34574",
      "text": " BGM：[蛍の光]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787139871,
      "updated": 1787140447
